#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How to use gradient map brush tips for loading multiple colors onto a brush."
msgstr ""
"Kako uporabljati gradient zemljevid krtačo nasveti za nalaganje več barv na "
"čopič."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:10
msgid "Rosemåling"
msgstr "Rosemåling"

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:10
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Current Brush Tip"
msgid "Gradient Brush Tips"
msgstr "Trenutna konica čopiča"

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:15
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Current Brush Tip"
msgid "Gradient Map Brush Tips"
msgstr "Trenutna konica čopiča"

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:17
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Used in Rosemåling and single-stroke flower paintings, the technique of "
"loading two separate colors can be emulated in Krita with :ref:`gradient-"
"mapped brush tips <predefined_brush_tip>`."
msgstr ""
"Uporablja se v Rosemåling in enotaktni cvet slike, tehnika nalaganja dveh "
"ločenih barv se lahko emulira v Krita z :ref:'gradient-mapped krtačo nasveti "
"<predefined_brush_tip>'."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:19
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Gradient mapped tips work much in the same way as the gradient map filter "
"does: The grey-values of each pixel in the brush is mapped to the gradient "
"color. As gradients can have some of their colors be assigned to be the fore "
"or background color, you can effectively make dual-loaded brush tips this "
"way."
msgstr ""
"Gradient preslikani nasveti delujejo veliko na enak način kot filter "
"prelivnega zemljevida: sive vrednosti vsakega piksla v čopič je preslikana "
"na barvo preliva. Ker lahko gradienti imajo nekatere od njihovih barv, ki so "
"dodeljene, da so v prednje ali ozadje barve, lahko učinkovito naredite "
"dvojno naložene krtače nasveti na ta način."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:25
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
".. image:: images/brush-tips/gradient_map_example.svg\n"
"   :alt: Graphic demonstrating how gradients map to grayscale values."
msgstr ""
".. slika:: slike/krtače-nasveti/gradient_map_example.svg\n"
"   :alt: Grafika, ki prikazuje, kako gradienti preslikajo vrednosti v sive "
"toske."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:25
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If we imagine a continuous color gradient mapping to a grayscale gradient, "
"we can imagine how grayscale colors can be transformed to the colors of the "
"gradient. This is called gradient mapping, because you are mapping a "
"grayscale to a gradient."
msgstr ""
"Če si predstavljamo nepretrgano barvno prelivno kartiranje v gradient sive "
"toske, si lahko predstavljamo, kako se barve sivih toska lahko spremenijo v "
"barve preliva. To se imenuje preliv kartiranje, ker kartiranje sive tone v "
"gradient."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:28
#, fuzzy
msgid "Making such a tip is actually quite easy:"
msgstr "Izdelava takšnega nasveta je pravzaprav precej enostavna:"

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid "Make a tip that's black on one side and white on the other"
msgstr "Naredite konico, ki je črna na eni strani in bela na drugi"

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:31
#, fuzzy
msgid ":menuselection:`Select --> Select All`"
msgstr ":menuselection:'Izberite --> Izberite vse'"

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:32
#, fuzzy
msgid ":menuselection:`Edit --> Copy Merged`"
msgstr ":menuselection:'Uredi --> Kopiraj združeno'"

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:33
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":kbd:`f5` to call up the brush settings. There, go to the :menuselection:"
"`Brush tip --> Predefined` tab, and select :guilabel:`Clipboard`."
msgstr ""
":kbd:'f5' za klic nastavitev krtače. Tam odprite zavihek :"
"menuselection:'Konica čopiča --> predefinirano' in izberite :"
"guilabel:'Odložišče'."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:34
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the popup, give it any name you want, and then make sure to **untick** :"
"guilabel:`Create Mask From Color` (as that would make the lighter colors "
"transparent). Press ok."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem okelu mu dajte želeno ime, nato pa se prepričajte, da **untick** :"
"guilabel:'Create Mask From Color' (saj bi to naredilo svetlejšo barvo "
"pregledno). Pritisnite ok."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:35
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then select the new brush tip. Set :guilabel:`Brush mode` to :guilabel:"
"`Gradient Map`, and adjust other brush settings like :guilabel:`Spacing`."
msgstr ""
"Nato izberite novo konico za krtačo. Nastavite :guilabel:'Način krtače' na :"
"guilabel:'Gradient Map' in prilagodite druge nastavitve čopiča, kot je :"
"guilabel:'Razmik'."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:36
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Draw with your brush. Switching the active gradient in the toolbar allows "
"you to use different colors. The :guilabel:`Fore to Background` gradient is "
"especially useful here, as it always uses the currently selected fore and "
"background color."
msgstr ""
"Riši s čopičem. Preklapljanje aktivnega preliva v orodni vrstici omogoča "
"uporabo različnih barv. Gradient :guilabel:'Fore to Background' je tukaj še "
"posebej uporaben, saj vedno uporablja trenutno izbrano barvo fore in ozadja."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
".. image:: images/brush-tips/gradient_map_tips.png\n"
"   :alt: A selection of different brush tips and their gradient map results."
msgstr ""
".. slika:: slike/krtače-nasveti/gradient_map_tips.png\n"
"   :alt: Izbor različnih nasvetov čopiča in rezultatov zemljevida preliva."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Different brush tips lead to different kinds of strokes. The last stroke in "
"the above examples was done using the :guilabel:`Lightness Map` brush mode, "
"which only uses the current foreground color."
msgstr ""
"Različni konici čopiča vodijo v različne vrste potez. Zadnji zamah v "
"zgornjih primerih je bil narejen z načinom čopiča :guilabel:'Lightness Map', "
"ki uporablja samo trenutno barvo v ospredju."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:43
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With :guilabel:`Rotation` to mapped to :guilabel:`Drawing angle`, you can "
"easily create effects like Rosemåling, while you'll need a tilt-enabled "
"tablet for single stroke brushes."
msgstr ""
"Z :guilabel:'Rotacija' za mapiranje na :guilabel:'Risalni kot', lahko "
"enostavno ustvarite učinke, kot je Rosemåling, medtem ko boste potrebovali "
"tablični računalnik z nagibom za ščetke za eno potezo."

#: ../../tutorials/krita-brush-tips/gradient_map_brush_tip.rst:51
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The texture option also has the ability to map its greys to a texture. "
"Combining both these gradient map functions together with the strength "
"parameter to switch between either, and you can make cool results like the "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Možnost tekstura ima tudi možnost, da preslika svoje sive na teksturo. "
"Kombiniranje obeh teh funkcij gradient zemljevida skupaj s parametrom moči, "
"da preklopite med bodisi, in lahko naredite kul rezultate, kot je zgoraj."
